      "body": "@synth , When a user selects Remove from the tab's drop-down menu, Teams will load the optional removeUrl page (designated in your configuration page) into an IFrame. Here, the user is presented with a button loaded with the onClick() function that calls microsoftTeams.settings.setValidityState(true) and enables the Remove button located near the bottom of the removal page IFrame. Please try to set contentUrl within setSettings.\r\n\r\n\r\nTeams enables the Remove button after 5 seconds, even if your tab hasn't called setValidityState().\r\nWhen the user selects Remove Teams removes the tab after 30 seconds regardless of whether your actions have completed.",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
