      "body": "@Trinetra-MSFT I'm referring to this: \r\n<img width=\"1425\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2020-01-22 at 11 56 15 AM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/10546/72929186-3a968180-3d0e-11ea-986c-0d2a7f63b099.png\">\r\n\r\nA user clicks \"Manage Team\", then clicks \"Apps\", then deletes the App. This causes (correctly) all the tabs to be removed from the team. However, the tab removal logic is not called during this flow. ",
