      "body": "@synth, thank you for the feedback. We are aware of the asks for an app/tab removal hook and is something we will be looking into. It’s important to keep in mind that tabs in and of themselves do not store any data; they are just pointers to external sites which store the data (not that different from contextually relevant bookmarks). Data access, compliance, and retention policies need to be handled by the external sites. You should not be relying on Teams to do that for you.",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "pin": null,
