      "body": "Thanks @ydogandjiev. It's good to know an app removal hook is on your radar. It's true the tab itself doesn't store any data, and it's us, as third parties, that are storing data. This is precisely the reason for a need for an app removal hook. In other words, the app removal hook can help 3rd parties to clean out data that should no longer be stored which follows international compliance requirements (gdpr, ccpa, etc).",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
