      "updated_at": "2022-11-21T07:57:40Z",
      "body": "Hi @synth, thank you for takin the time to report this issue. The specific behavior of setValidityState that you have described is by design. We do not want to allow app developers to intentionally or accidentally block users from being able to delete their tabs. That is why we automatically enable the \"Remove\" button after 5 seconds and allow the user to force delete the tab.",
